    "color": "#4a6b3c",
    "overview": "<p>Field Works is the execution side of a project, where field teams log real work against the structure Project Setup defined. Its five top tabs are Tree Version, Safety, Drawing Management, Invoices, and Workorder. Tree Version mirrors the project's plants and work packages; opening a plant reveals a second-level tab bar — Progress (18 cards), Quick Apps, Quality, Project Forms, and Cost — so every log, inspection, form, and cost movement stays scoped to the work package it belongs to.</p>",
